# Font binaries are never committed.
#
# The open faces (Inter, Source Serif 4, JetBrains Mono) are fetched on demand
# by fonts/fetch-fonts.mjs. The licensed faces (Styrene, Tiempos, Berkeley
# Mono) are commercial and must not enter version control at all — a webfont
# licence does not survive a public repo.
fonts/files/
!fonts/files/.gitkeep
